You found the secret dummy disk!
Not many adventurers make it here.
The Kagu bird hides its shiniest treasures
on this tiny partition.

Fun fact: The real Kagu bird is native to New Caledonia
and is known for its beautiful crest and barking call!
The Legend of Chef Kagu
=======================
Long ago, in the land of Bare Metal,
a young Kagu bird dreamed of running a restaurant.
With nothing but a boot sector and a dream,
Kagu learned to manage memory, schedule tasks,
and serve processes with grace and efficiency.
Today, Kagu's Restaurant has three Michelin stars
and serves thousands of system calls per second.
The end. (Or is it just the beginning?)







